'''{{BASEPAGENAME}}''' is a [[:Category:Serbia|Serbian]] esports organization.  Their ''Dota 2'' division was initially based in [[:Category:Malaysia|Malaysia]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/auroradotagg/videos/375238471744880|title=Oli was the first to rate our gaming house in Malaysia|author=Aurora|date=2023-12-18}}</ref>

