{{tabs dynamic/tab|1}}<!--2023-->
*November 13 - A new roster is announced; [[23]], [[Armel]], [[Jabz]], [[Q (Thai player)|Q]] and [[Oli]] join the team.<ref name="aurora 20231113">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1724019282961735688|title=New season, new players and new challenges for us!|author=Aurora|date=2023-11-13}}</ref><ref name="aurora 20230901">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/eric.khor.wei.soon/posts/7661717703872441|title=Started new job at Aurora Dota2|author=Eric Khor|author-link=ReiNNNN|date=2023-09-01}}</ref>

{{tabs dynamic/tab|2}}<!--2024-->
*February 2 - [[SunBhie]] joins the team as coach.<ref name="aurora 20240202">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1753463294550040810|title=We are pleased to welcome our new coach|author=Aurora|date=2024-02-02}}</ref>
*March 14 - [[Armel]] is moved to inactive.<ref name="aurora 20240314">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1768220570833846732|title=Armel will be moved to the benched position.|author=Aurora|date=2024-03-14}}</ref>
*March 16 - [[lorenof]] joins the team.<ref name="aurora 20240316">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1768955380384604209|title=We welcome Artem «Lorenof» Melnick to Aurora as our new position 2 mid laner!|author=Aurora|date=2024-03-16}}</ref>
*September 19 - The team part ways with [[23]] and [[Oli]].<ref name="aurora 20240919">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1836721913445470681|title=Today, we bid farewell to 23 and Oli as they part ways with our Dota 2 team.|author=Aurora|date=2024-09-19}}</ref>
*September 20 - [[lorenof]] is moved to inactive,<ref name="aurora 20240920l">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1837023897067127277|title=Today, we are moving Lorenof from the active roster to the bench|author=Aurora|date=2024-09-20}}</ref> [[kiyotaka]] joins the team as a streamer.<ref name="aurora 20240920k">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1837086932997685430|title=We were gonna keep this under wraps until later|author=Aurora|date=2024-09-20}}</ref>
*September 22 - [[TA2000]], [[Abed]] and [[kaori]] join the team.<ref name="aurora 20240922">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1837748667035668643|title=THE WAIT IS FINALLY OVER!|author=Aurora|date=2024-09-22}}</ref>
*September 27 - Streamer [[kiyotaka]] is transferred to [[BetBoom Team]].<ref name="aurora 20240927">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1839718015950037503|title=THANKS FOR EVERYTHING, KIYOTAKA!|author=Aurora|date=2024-09-27}}</ref>
*November 1 - The team parts ways with [[kaori]].<ref name="aurora 20241101">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1852304582560653473|title=It’s never easy, but today we say goodbye to Kaori as we part ways.|author=Aurora|date=2024-11-01}}</ref>
*November 12 - [[Malady]] joins the team.<ref name="aurora 20241112">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1856290852827439479|title=We know y’all have been waiting, and the time is finally here!|author=Aurora|date=2024-11-12}}</ref>
*December 6 - [[TA2000]] and [[Malady]] are benched.<ref name="aurora 20241206">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1864988153893077039|title=We have something to tell....|author=Aurora|date=2024-12-06}}</ref>
*December 7 - [[Oli]] rejoins the team.<ref name="aurora 20241207">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1864988153893077039|title=We have something to tell....|author=Aurora|date=2024-12-06}}</ref>
*December 15 - [[Malady]] is transferred to [[L1GA TEAM]].<ref name="aurora 20241215">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1868235098526715919|title=TRANSFER|author=Aurora|date=2024-12-15}}</ref>

{{tabs dynamic/tab|3}}<!--2025-->
*January 2 - [[Palos]] joins the team.<ref name="aurora 20250102">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1874772639887028359|title=Stand-in no more!|author=Aurora|date=2025-01-02}}</ref>
*February 5 - [[Palos]], [[Oli]] and coach [[SunBhie]] become free agents while [[Abed]], [[Jabz]] and [[Q (Thai player)|Q]] are moved to the transfer list.<ref name="aurora 20250205">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1887051363739160630|title=It has been an incredibly long and exhausting story.|author=Aurora|date=2025-02-05}}</ref>
*February 19 - [[Q (Thai player)|Q]] becomes a free agent.<ref name="aurora 20250219">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/QDota2/posts/1277807240458918|title=My new journey is beginning.|author=Q|date=2025-02-19}}</ref>
*February 24 - [[Abed]] becomes a free agent.<ref name="aurora 20250224">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/abedyusop/status/1894044192529137731|title=free agent LFT|author=Abed|date=2025-02-24}}</ref>
*February 28 - A new roster is announced; [[Nightfall]], [[kiyotaka]], [[TORONTOTOKYO]], [[Mira]] and [[panto]] join the team while [[TA2000]] and [[lorenof]] join [[Chimera Esports]].<ref name="aurora 20250228">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1895459449797824797|title=Guess who’s back.|author=Aurora|date=2025-02-25}}</ref><ref name="aurora 20250228tl">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/s/chimera_esports|title=ИЗМЕНЕНИЯ В CHIMERA ESPORTS|author=Chimera Esports|date=2025-02-25}}</ref>
*March 21 - [[DoublA]] joins the team as manager.<ref name="aurora 20250321">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/DoublA_Dota/status/1903131186366386482|title=A tiny bit of spring cleaning on my twitter.|author=DoublA|date=2025-03-21}}</ref>
*March 29 - [[G]] joins the team as coach.<ref name="aurora 20250329">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1905968587187065273|title="WHERE'S YOUR COACH" — the most frequently asked question in the comments...|author=Aurora Dota2|date=2025-03-29}}</ref>
*April 20 - [[Armel]] and [[Jabz]] join [[BOOM Esports]].<ref name="aurora 20250420a">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/boomesportsid/status/1913948003486101602|title=we welcome Armel to BOOM Esports|author=BOOM Esports|date=2025-04-20}}</ref><ref name="aurora 20250420j">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/boomesportsid/status/1913931477718626439|title=Jabz is now officially part of the wolfpack!|author=BOOM Esports|date=2025-04-20}}</ref>
*October 8 - [[kiyotaka]] and [[panto]] are benched while [[Oli]] joins the team.<ref name="aurora 20251008kp">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1975971282719219881|title=Effective today, Gleb "kiyotaka" Zyryanov and Nikita "panto" Balaganin have been moved to the substitute bench.|author=Aurora Dota2|date=2025-10-08}}</ref><ref name="aurora 20251008o">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1975979649210667085|title=We are happy to announce that Chang @jackchantheoli Chon Kien joins Aurora Gaming!|author=Aurora Dota2|date=2025-10-08}}</ref>
*October 9 - [[panto]] joins [[Team Spirit]],<ref name="aurora 20251009p">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1976271621599227959|title=Sometimes, short time together feels like a whole life.|author=Aurora Dota2|date=2025-10-09}}</ref> [[kpii]] (Coach) joins the team.<ref name="aurora 20251009k">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1976357578276995276|title=Today @kpiidota Joins the coaching staff at Aurora Gaming!|author=Aurora Dota2|date=2025-10-09}}</ref>
*October 17 - [[Mikoto]] joins the team.<ref name="aurora 20251017">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/1979173297053893034|title=Not a stand-in anymore.|author=Aurora Dota2|date=2025-10-17}}</ref>

{{tabs dynamic/tab|4}}<!--2026-->
*January 7 - The team parts ways with [[Oli]] while [[TORONTOTOKYO]] takes a competitive break.<ref name="aurora 20260107">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/2008929611556458940|title=Sometimes we have to say goodbye...|author=Aurora|date=2026-01-07}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://t.me/Aurora_Dota2/4496|title=К сожалению, иногда приходится прощаться…|author=Aurora|date=2026-01-07}}</ref>
*January 8 - [[Ws]] and [[kaori]] join the team.<ref name="aurora 20260108">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/AuroraDota2_GG/status/2009240789340266628|title=NEWS, NEWS, NEWS!|author=Aurora|date=2026-01-08}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://t.me/Aurora_Dota2/4497|title=ДОБРО ПОЖАЛОВАТЬ!|author=Aurora|date=2026-01-08}}</ref>
*September 14 - [[TORONTOTOKYO]] joins [[BetBoom Team]].<ref name="aurora 20260914">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/betboomteam/7057|title=НОВЫЙ СОСТАВ BETBOOM TEAM!|trans_title=|author=BetBoom Team|date=2026-09-14}}</ref>
