'''Gaimin Gladiators''' (also known as '''GG''') is a [[:Category:Canada|Canadian]] esports organization. They entered the ''Dota 2'' competitive scene in February 2022 with the signing of [[Team Tickles]] competing in Western Europe.<ref name="tt 20220208">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GaiminGladiator/status/1491034229358034952|title=As we embark on this journey to TI we aim to captivate and entertain Dota 2 fans around the world.|author=GaiminGladiator|date=2022-02-08}}</ref> GG dominated the 2023 DPC Season winning all three of Valve's Majors.

