'''PSG Quest''' (also known as '''Quest Esports''', formerly known as '''Ooredoo Thunders''') is a [[:Category:Qatar|Qatari]] esports organization. On October 10, 2023, Quest Esports entered a partnership with French football club [[wikipedia:Paris_Saint-Germain_F.C.|Paris Saint-Germain]]. The squad rebranded to '''PSG Quest'''.<ref name="psg quest">{{cite web|url=https://www.psg.fr/equipes/the-club/content/le-psg-esports-sassocie-avec-quest-esports-pour-son-grand-retour-sur-dota-2|title=Le PSG Esports s'associe avec Quest Esports pour son grand retour sur Dota 2|author=PSG eSports|publisher=www.psg.fr|date=2023-10-10}}</ref>

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2022
|name2=2023
|name3=2024
|This=3
}}
{{tabs dynamic/tab|1}}<!--2022-->
*July 2nd - The roster is announced, consisting of; [[SlaweE]], [[No!ob]], [[ruustle]], [[OmaR]] and [[Eixn]].<ref name="ot 20220702">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/OoredooNation/status/1543213098814898176|title=We have seen the future and we are absolutely dominating it!|author=Ooredoo Nation|date=2022-07-02}}</ref>
*September 16th - [[SlaweE]] and [[Eixn]] are replaced by [[TA2000]] and [[kaori]].<ref name="ot 20220916t">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/OoredooNation/status/1590028977921413120|title=Ranked 5th in Europe and ready to throw the enemies into an endless void.|author=Ooredoo Nation|date=2022-09-23}}</ref><ref name="ot 20220916k">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-200815105_9630|title=Айбек "TA2000" Токаев и Олег "kaori" Медведок переходят(трансфер) в команду Ooredoo Thunders.|author=Project Armor|date=2022-09-16}}</ref>
*November 23rd - [[ruustle]] is replaced by [[Wuiter]].<ref name="ot 20221123">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/ClT_i79NUK8/|title=None can stand against him!|author=Ooredoo Nation|date=2022-11-23}}</ref>
*December 20th - [[Accell]] is revealed as coach.<ref name="ot 20221220">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/CmZTBtWtt7U/|title=We feel the rush!|author=Ooredoo Nation|date=2022-12-20}}</ref>

{{tabs dynamic/tab|2}}<!--2023-->
*April 21 - [[Wuiter]] leaves the team.<ref name="ot 20230421">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/WuiterDOTA/status/1649476407766949893|title=Looking for team upcoming dpc series|author=Wuiter|date=2023-04-21}}</ref>
*April 29 - The organization ceased partnership with [https://www.ooredoo.qa/web/en/ Ooredoo], the team name became [[Quest Esports]].<ref name="qe 20230429">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/questesports_/status/1652223259629289473|title=New patch New name And we still dominate the DOTA2 scene|author=Quest Esports|date=2023-04-29}}</ref>
*May 9 - [[ATF]] joins the team on loan from [[Nigma Galaxy]] for the remainder of the season.<ref name="qe 20230509">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/questesports_/status/1655905540759855107|title=We're thrilled to announce that the legendary @AmmarAlassaf6 aka ATF is joining Quest Esports' Dota 2 team on loan from @NigmaGalaxy!|author=Quest Esports|date=2023-05-09}}</ref><ref name="nigma 20230509">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/NigmaGalaxy/status/1655905505775173633|title=ATF will spend the next DPC season on loan at @questesports_!|author=NigmaGalaxy|date=2023-05-09}}</ref>
*May 21 - [[Eixn]] is no longer the manager.<ref name="qe 20230521">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/EixnDota/status/1660367481028984833|title=anyways i will no longer be co managing|author=Jad Hammoud|date=2023-05-21}}</ref>
*July 10 - The team parts ways with coach [[Accell]].<ref name="qe 20230710">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/questesports_/status/1678407933204348930|title=With sincere gratitude, we bid farewell to Accell, our DOTA2 coach.|author=Quest Esports|date=2023-07-10}}</ref>
*July 15 - [[ATF]] leaves the team after expiration of his agreed loan period.<ref name="qe 20230715">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/questesports_/status/1680181868434432001|title=We regret to inform you that, due to contractual issues, Ammar al Assaf (ATF) @AmmarAlassaf6 will no longer be part of the Quest Esports team.|author=Quest Esports
|date=2023-07-15}}</ref>
*July 16 - [[Malik]] stand-in for the team at [[Riyadh Masters/2023|Riyadh Masters 2023]], [[GuessWho]] joins the team as coach.<ref name="qe 20230716m">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/questesports_/status/1680554721961037824|title=Join us in giving a warm welcome to Malik|author=Quest Esports|date=2023-07-16}}</ref><ref name="qe 20230716gw">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/questesports_/status/1680603684277714944|title=Guesswho has just joined our quest for greatness!k|author=Quest Esports|date=2023-07-16}}</ref>
*August 10 - [[Tobi (Austrian player)|Tobi]] joins the team.<ref name="qe 20230810">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/questesports_/status/1689614824135667712|title=Our Quest to #TI12 Continues!|author=Quest Esports|date=2023-08-10}}</ref>
*September 8 - The team parts ways with coach [[GuessWho]], he is replaced by [[Daxak]].<ref name="qe 20230908gw">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/questesports_/status/1700100555446587465|title=Our journey was brief but memorable|author=Quest Esports|date=2023-09-08}}</ref><ref name="qe 20230908d">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/questesports_/status/1700103278875279735|title=Introducing our new Dota 2 maestro|author=Quest Esports|date=2023-09-08}}</ref>
*October 10 - The team enters a partnership with [[wikipedia:Paris_Saint-Germain_F.C.|Paris Saint-Germain]]. The team name becomes '''PSG Quest'''.<ref name="psg quest"/><ref>{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/PSGeSports/status/1711784542846287945|title=DOTA 2 FANS, PSG IS BACK!|author=PSG Esports|date=2023-10-10}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/questesports_/status/1711784193867321502|title=From the Seine to the dunes of Qatar, a new #Dota2 alliance emerges.|author=Quest Esports|date=2023-10-10}}</ref>
*October 31 - The team parts ways with [[Tobi (Austrian player)|Tobi]].<ref name="qe 20231031">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/questesports_/status/1719351734202409328|title=Today, we're wrapping up our collaboration with @TobiDotes as our first-ever TI comes to an end.|author=Quest Esports|date=2023-10-31}}</ref>
*November 11 - [[Malik]] joins the team on loan from [[Natus Vincere]].<ref name="qe 20231111">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/PSGQuest/status/1723417406779896203|title=Malik is back!!|author=PSG Quest|date=2023-11-11}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/natusvincere/status/1723672719659512048|title=NAVI Dota 2 roster for upcoming tournaments|author=Natus Vincere|date=2023-11-12}}</ref>
*December 29 - [[Malik]] becomes a full-time member.<ref name="qe 20231229">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/PSGQuest/status/1740794886809682234|title=No more loans!|author=PSG Quest|date=2023-12-29}}</ref>

{{tabs dynamic/tab|3}}<!--2024-->
*January 17 - Coach [[Daxak]] is no longer with the team.<ref name="qe 20240117">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/daxak4/219|title=Я ушёл/меня кикнули из орги|author=Daxak|date=2024-01-17}}</ref><ref name="qe 20240121">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/PSGQuest/status/1749025262195355846|title=Today, we bid farewell to @DaxakDota2.|author=PSG Quest|date=2024-01-21}}</ref>
*January 29 - [[Accell]] becomes a full-time coach again.<ref name="qe 20240129">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/Accell_7/201|title=В PSG Quest вернулся старый тренер|author=Accell|date=2024-01-29}}</ref>
*March 10 - The team parts ways with [[kaori]], he is replaced by [[Dukalis]].<ref name="qe 20240310k">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/PSGQuest/status/1766781481437782235|title=With mixed emotions, we part ways with Kaori|author=PSG Quest|date=2024-03-10}}</ref><ref name="qe 20240310d">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/PSGQuest/status/1766791528427421846|title=Excited to officially welcome @Dukalisdota2 to #PSGQuest!|author=PSG Quest|date=2024-03-10}}</ref>
*August 13 - [[Eixn]] joins the team as ''Head of Esports''.<ref name="qe 20240813">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PSGQuest/status/1823343729450660302|title=He has been with us from the start, and now he’s stepping up to lead our esports division|author=PSG Quest|date=2024-08-13}}</ref>
*September 18 - In an [https://youtu.be/QGGmNtRy4is interview], [[OmaR]] reveals that the roster disbanded.<ref name="qst 20240918">{{cite web|url=https://youtu.be/QGGmNtRy4is|title=PGL Wallachia S2 Interview - OmaR (Nigma Galaxy)|author=PGL|date=2024-10-05}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PSGQuest/status/1849739879061627130|title=An Important Update from PSGQuest|author=PSG Quest|date=2024-10-25}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PSGQuest/status/1849745557209636918|title=Thank you|author=PSG Quest|date=2024-10-25}}</ref>
{{tabs dynamic/end}}

